{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_23_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_23","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_23_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_23","textTraditional":"二、夏六月壬寅，公會紀侯、莒子，盟于毆蛇。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_23_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_23","textTraditional":"三、秋七月丁亥，公會宋公、燕人，盟于穀丘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_23_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_23","textTraditional":"四、八月壬辰，陳侯躍卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_23_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_23","textTraditional":"五、公會宋公于郯。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_23_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_23","textTraditional":"六、冬十有一月，公會宋公于龜。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_23_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_23","textTraditional":"七、丙戌，公會鄭伯，盟于武父。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_23_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_23","textTraditional":"八、丙戌，衞侯晉卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_23_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_23","textTraditional":"七、十有二月，及鄭師伐宋。丁未，戰于宋。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_23_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_23","textTraditional":"戰不言伐，此其言伐何？辟嫌也。惡乎嫌？嫌與鄭人戰也。此偏戰也，何以不言師敗績？內不言戰，言戰乃敗矣。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}